     "text": "3."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "EXT. LOADING DOCK - NIGHT"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Rain on corrugated steel. WREN wheels a cart of film cans"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "out under a sodium lamp and counts them twice."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "HOLT holds an umbrella over the cart and not over himself."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "WREN"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Forty-one. There were forty-three"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "when we started."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "HOLT"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Two of them went out for repair in"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "March and nobody wrote it down."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "WREN"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Nobody ever writes it down."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "She pulls a tarp over the cart and ties it at the corners."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "HOLT"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "The truck comes at six. Everything"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "on that manifest has to be on the"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "dock by then, in order, and dry."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "WREN"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Then we work through it."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "The lamp buzzes and cuts out. Neither of them stops moving."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "In the dark the cart is a long shape and the rain is louder"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "than it was."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "WREN"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Bring the second cart. And the good"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "tarp, not the one with the hole in"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "it."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Holt goes. Wren stands in the rain with a clipboard and does"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "not hurry."
    }
